<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\車内後部座席.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電話呼び出し.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "4000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Hello, this is <STYLE ID="1">Ise</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've just driven <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi Kogori</STYLE>-san and the others to a family restaurant near her home.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A family restaurant called Zahha.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, I'm in the parking lot of a nearby convenience store now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We will now capture the suspect and, at the same time, protect the subject.<PG>
No, the subject is being left as is.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll secretly contact <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi Kogori-san</STYLE> and tell her not to take her eyes off the subject.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd like Prefectural Police Headquarters to proceed with preparations and backup for capturing the suspect as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yes... yes... 
{PAUSE ""}
As for the suspect, that's almost certainly right.<PG>
The suspect is the culprit of the Megasawa City case.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no predicting what the suspect will do, so to be safe, please don't neglect your equipment.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If the suspect moves the way the rumors say... 
{PAUSE ""}
guns won't work.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
However, we need to keep this covert, so that neither the suspect nor the subject notices.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Keep the numbers to the minimum necessary... yes...<PG>
As for the arrest warrant procedure...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right, of course it can't be done the same day...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Understood, as an emergency arrest, then.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then, I'm counting on you.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\タバコ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Now, whether a country police force like ours can make the arrest..."</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------